ler shoot'em-up game. You play as a physically simulated ooze that loots equipment and powers off its enemies. Select from a wide variety of weapons and passive equipment to fine-tune your build. Loot gold throughout your run to earn upgrades before venturing back into the tower to try and reach the top. Explore dank dungeons and discover hidden secrets, unlock new oozes to play as, and take your rightful place at the top of the tower!", "short_description": "Ooze your way through dank dungeons and dissolve thousands of monsters in this top-down shoot’em up roguelite. Slay enough and gather their essence to earn new cards from the Witch’s deck. Defeat powerful foes and explore deep places to earn more cards for your deck!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618800/header.jpg?t=1785092969", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785092969", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1618800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785092969", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 3rd gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 or AMD Radeon HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 7th gen (or equivalent)<br></li><li